#. detail 8:  ~700+ fps
#. detail 9:  ~400 fps
#. detail 10: ~300 fps
#. detail 11: ~100 fps
#. detail 12:  ~50 fps
#. detail 13:  ~17 fps
#. detail 14:   ~8 fps
#. detail 15:   ~2 fps
#.
#. With the default -delay, CPU load only starts causing the frame rate
#. to drop below 30 fps detail 12 or higher.
#.
