"\n"
"WARNING: THE INTERNET SOMETIMES CONTAINS PORNOGRAPHY.\n"
"\n"
"The Internet being what it is, absolutely anything might show up in the\n"
"collage including -- quite possibly -- pornography, or even nudity.\n"
